stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DISCOVERED : Engine registered in manifest

    DISCOVERED --> REGISTERED : RegisterEngine()
    REGISTERED --> VALIDATING : Validate()
    VALIDATING --> INITIALIZING : Validation passed
    VALIDATING --> FAILED : Validation failed

    INITIALIZING --> INITIALIZED : Allocate memory & load models
    INITIALIZING --> FAILED : Initialization error

    INITIALIZED --> STARTING : Start() command
    STARTING --> RUNNING : Event loops active & connected
    STARTING --> FAILED : Startup error

    RUNNING --> DEGRADED : Sensor dropout / Fallback CPU triggered
    DEGRADED --> RUNNING : Resource recovery / Sensor restored

    RUNNING --> PAUSED : Pause() command
    PAUSED --> RUNNING : Resume() command

    RUNNING --> STOPPING : Stop() command
    DEGRADED --> STOPPING : Stop() command
    PAUSED --> STOPPING : Stop() command

    STOPPING --> STOPPED : Shutdown complete & resources freed
    STOPPED --> INITIALIZING : Restart() cycle

    FAILED --> STOPPING : Fatal error containment
    STOPPED --> [*] : Unregister
